  "solution": "<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/d82b9cd229f13da2910101d764c2cf26ecd3c53d60e4e45b154a7b2c7db984ac.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tDiện tích <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></semantics></math> của hình vuông <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>-Cạnh hình vuông <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mo>ABCD</mo></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>a</mi></semantics></math>, nên diện tích <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Diện tích hình vuông <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>-Đường chéo hình vuông ABCD là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>-Cạnh hình vuông <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math> bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></semantics></math> đường chéo của hình vuông <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, tức là \n\t\tcạnh hình vuông <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>-Diện tích <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></semantics></math> của hình vuông <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math> là \n\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math><br>Diện tích hình vuông <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow